@startuml bearer_vs_none
title Optional Bearer — ignore claims when header absent

actor User
participant API
database SQLite

alt no Authorization header
  User -> API : POST /api/chats/{id}/nodes
  API -> API : parseBearer: nothing to check
  API -> SQLite : INSERT chat_nodes
  API --> User : 201
  note over API : unauthenticated / legacy path
else Bearer present
  User -> API : POST /api/chats/{id}/nodes\nAuthorization: Bearer …
  API -> SQLite : validate access token + live grants
  API -> SQLite : resolve chat → topic → content_client
  alt matching write topic claim
    API -> SQLite : INSERT chat_nodes
    API --> User : 201
  else other studio or read-only claim
    API --> User : 403
  end
end

@enduml
